"text": "Windows hides a faster power mode.\nOpen Settings, then System, then Power.\nFind Power mode.\nIt's on Balanced by default.\nSwitch it to Best performance.\nNow your PC puts speed first.\nOn a laptop, it uses more battery.\nFollow for more Windows fixes."
